# MIT License

Test program for Indy robots

Connection settings are taken from the command line arguments, falling back to
environment variables when an argument is omitted:

  ROBOT_NAME    robot name (required)
  MONGO_URI     --server    MongoDB host
  MONGO_PORT    --port      MongoDB port

Run as follows from test_program folder:

export ROBOT_NAME=<robot name>
export MONGO_URI=<hostname>          # e.g. example.local
export MONGO_PORT=9000
python3 schedule_scripts.py

or pass them explicitly:

python3 schedule_scripts.py --server=example.local --port=9000

The same server holds the configuration and the test results. Databases used:

  system_monitor   test definitions (collection: hardware_config)
  log              test result history
  current_status   latest status per test
  tBlackBoard      error events (collection: physical_topic)

Configuration is stored in MongoDB
database: system_monitor
collection: hardware_config

Format of the entries is as follows:

{
    _id: ObjectId('67a5be1d7345e7223451a479'),
    robot: 'indy1',
    test: 'hw-ttyusb0',
    host: 'example.local',
    type: 'DEVPERMS',
    args: [
        '/dev/ttyUSB0',
        '777'
    ],
    frequency: '5'
}

When schedule_scripts.py is run, it fetches the tests for the current robot and host and runs each test in a separate thread. Frequency determines how often the test is run.
Valid test types are LSUSB, DEVPERMS, PING, DISK

When an error is found, tBlackBoard physical_topic gets a error entry where hyphens are converted to underscores and an _error is added. For the above: hw_ttyusb0_error

These can be used as triggers for the scenario manager as follows:

{
    _id: ObjectId('67b6e67eef8b4ea5c524caab'),
    name: 'ttyusb0 Error',
    status: 'active',
    trigger: [
        {
            hw_ttyusb0_error: null
        }
    ],
    priority: 1000,
    'return': false,
    ignore_after_activated: 5,
    ignore_same_observations: false,
    events: [
        {
            actor: 'robot1',
            type: 'action',
            utterance: {
                type: 'normal',
                sentence: 'ハードttyUSB0が見つかりません。困りました！'
            },
            interruptable: false
        }
    ]
}
